  m_Text: "MOVE\n  WASD or arrow keys\n  Swipe on mobile\n\nPOWER SHOT\n  Space,
    when the power meter is full\n\nUSE ABILITY\n  E, when one is stored\n\nPAUSE\n 
    Esc, or the pause button\n\nGOAL\n  Leave safe territory to draw a trail and\n 
    reconnect to capture space. Capture 75%\n  to clear the stage."
